msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "简介"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:19
#: 71012e7900df447983da70413b4c1a08
msgid ""
"Want a robust development environment for the APM code?  Try out Atmel "
"Studio 6.2 or Microsoft Visual Studio with the \\ `Visual Micro "
"<https://www.visualmicro.com/>`__ plugin. You can edit, build and upload the"
" APM code using these tools. The builds and uploads are the same as with the"
" ArduPilot Ardunio builds."
msgstr ""
"想要为 APM 代码构建一个强大的开发环境？试试 Atmel Studio 6.2 或带 `Visual Micro "
"<https://www.visualmicro.com/>`__ 插件的 Microsoft Visual "
"Studio。您可以使用这些工具编辑、构建和上传 APM 代码。构建和上传方式与使用 ArduPilot Arduino 构建相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:27
#: ccdf28c34b80437bbdd98097395b3a79
msgid "Click the image to enlarge"
msgstr "点击图片放大"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:29
#: 3b13aaaf0d0246cbaea5ee12ef250846
msgid ""
"**Overview:** Atmel Studio or Microsoft Visual Studio provides a robust "
"Integrated Development Environment (IDE). However, the ArduPilot code is set"
" up to use the special ArduPilot Arduino IDE and that structure does not "
"work in those environments without some plugin to setup the correct "
"structure and provide the up-load tools. Finding the source code for the "
"various functions and classes is difficult using Arduino - sometimes "
"requiring a manual search through multiple folders and files to find the "
"actual source code for one function or class used in the main code setup or "
"loop."
msgstr ""
"**概述：** Atmel Studio 或 Microsoft Visual Studio "
"提供了强大的集成开发环境（IDE）。但是，ArduPilot 代码的设置使用了特殊的 ArduPilot Arduino "
"IDE，这种结构在没有插件提供正确结构和上传工具的情况下无法在这些环境中工作。使用 Arduino "
"查找各种函数和类的源代码很困难——有时需要手动搜索多个文件夹才能找到 main 代码 setup 或 loop 中使用的某个函数或类的实际源代码。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:39
#: 3fafae995397462d8054693414de6300
msgid ""
"**Solution:** Visual Micro solves most of these problems. Visual Micro is a "
"plugin to Atmel Studio or Visual Studio that adds the following features:"
msgstr ""
"**解决方案：** Visual Micro 解决了这些问题中的大多数。Visual Micro 是 Atmel Studio 或 Visual "
"Studio 的插件，添加了以下功能："

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:43
#: 13385d1fae914359b1ff43bf5300f316
msgid ""
"Compatibility with the Arduino Code structure, libraries, file naming and "
"sketches - with the robust studio IDE."
msgstr "与 Arduino 代码结构、库、文件命名和 sketch 兼容——同时拥有强大的 studio IDE。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:45
#: 646e2cecd3874d4a8e6328f25ce0c857
msgid ""
"Uploading Arduino sketches to any of the Arduino boards - and, to the APM "
"boards."
msgstr "可将 Arduino sketch 上传到任何 Arduino 开发板，以及 APM 开发板。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:47
#: a0048ea87c7f4423b775c7d7d1e680d2
msgid ""
"All the files are shown in the solution panel, making it easy to open, "
"browse or edit any file."
msgstr "所有文件都显示在解决方案面板中，方便打开、浏览或编辑任何文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:49
#: 6b251ccaef6647208e1d6228db70b081
msgid ""
"Take a look at the \\ `Visual Micro <https://www.visualmicro.com/>`__ "
"website for all the details."
msgstr "请访问 `Visual Micro <https://www.visualmicro.com/>`__ 网站了解所有详细信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:50
#: d77c4c1eb6ec46f0b37ee034877ef88a
msgid ""
"Visual Micro has a debug feature when used with standard Arduino sketches "
"but the APM code has removed or modified much of the standard Arduino "
"features like Serial.print() and the hardware Serial features. The Visual "
"Micro debugger does not work with APM. However, do not let that dissuade you"
" from trying the Atmel Studio or Visual Studio IDE."
msgstr ""
"Visual Micro 在与标准 Arduino sketch 配合使用时有调试功能，但 APM 代码已移除或修改了许多标准 Arduino "
"功能，例如 Serial.print() 和硬件 Serial 功能。Visual Micro 调试器无法与 APM 配合使用。但不要因此放弃尝试 "
"Atmel Studio 或 Visual Studio IDE。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:57
#: c940cf663d1a4f5bb4c53e2bfb5e3120
msgid ""
"Here you will find a step by step process to set up Atmel Studio or Visual "
"Studio to browse, edit, build and upload the APM code.  Special thanks to "
"Tim Leek at Visual Micro for developing this great plugin and for his help "
"in creating this document."
msgstr ""
"这里提供了设置 Atmel Studio 或 Visual Studio 以浏览、编辑、构建和上传 APM 代码的逐步过程。特别感谢 Visual "
"Micro 的 Tim Leek 开发了这个出色的插件，并在创建本文档方面提供了帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:63
#: c5e2b3e052d641bb991acf6af6090270
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:65
#: afe6ff3c99c74b5e911f296f7f7c3403
msgid ""
"Even if you are not a current user of Atmel Studio or Visual Studio Pro, but"
" have used Arduino IDE to build the APM code, then this process will get you"
" started. Links to other wiki pages are provided where appropriate for more "
"detail.  No detail is included for Visual Studio or Atmel Studio features. "
"You will need to learn that on your own."
msgstr ""
"即使您目前不是 Atmel Studio 或 Visual Studio Pro 的用户，但曾使用 Arduino IDE 构建 APM "
"代码，本流程也能帮您入门。适当的地方提供了其他 wiki 页面的链接以获取更多详细信息。不包括 Visual Studio 或 Atmel Studio"
" 功能的详细说明，您需要自行了解。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:71
#: 7dccfbc6befb44178d5f19c3fcf63c78
msgid ""
"The  `Visual Micro <https://www.visualmicro.com/>`__ website explains how to"
" install Visual Micro for Arduino and how to set up Atmel Studio or Visual "
"Studio to work with Arduino sketches and boards. What is not clearly covered"
" is how to add support for the APM boards. Once that information is clear, "
"the set up is quite simple. Here is a summary of the key steps required:"
msgstr ""
"`Visual Micro <https://www.visualmicro.com/>`__ 网站介绍了如何为 Arduino 安装 Visual "
"Micro 以及如何设置 Atmel Studio 或 Visual Studio 来处理 Arduino sketch "
"和开发板。尚未明确说明的是如何添加对 APM 开发板的支持。一旦该信息明确，设置就相当简单了。以下是所需关键步骤的摘要："

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:78
#: f1a8dd3892434bf889a979933fa06bb5
msgid "Assumptions:"
msgstr "前提："

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:80
#: d41d64ca308945fd99dc47144c240032
msgid ""
"The special ArduPilot Arduino must be installed and tested to build and "
"upload the code. The complete details are :ref:`here <building-ardupilot-"
"with-arduino-windows>`. For this example it is assumed that the installation"
" is at C:\\\\ArduPilot-Arduino-1.0.3-windows."
msgstr ""
"必须安装并测试特殊的 ArduPilot Arduino 以构建和上传代码。完整详情请参阅 :ref:`here <building-"
"ardupilot-with-arduino-windows>`。本例假设安装路径为 C:\\\\ArduPilot-"
"Arduino-1.0.3-windows。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:85
#: 9a9474eb0ec74a2b9454ed6685abd79b
msgid ""
"You need `Atmel Studio 6.2 <https://www.microchip.com/mplab/avr-"
"support/atmel-studio-7>`__ (free) or a licensed full version of  Visual "
"Studio Pro 2008, 2010 or 2012 installed. Visual Micro does not work with the"
" free Express versions of Visual Studio.  Visual Studio 2008 is used in this"
" example."
msgstr ""
"您需要 `Atmel Studio 6.2 <https://www.microchip.com/mplab/avr-support/atmel-"
"studio-7>`__（免费）或已授权的完整版 Visual Studio Pro 2008、2010 或 2012。Visual Micro "
"不支持免费的 Visual Studio Express 版本。本例使用 Visual Studio 2008。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:90
#: 90fa573afaea4e1f82b6b59b964d46f3
msgid ""
"You need the ArduPilot source code. For this tutorial the APM source code is"
" assumed to be located in C:\\\\Users\\\\Public\\\\Documents\\\\ardupilot-"
"Copter-3.1.3."
msgstr ""
"您需要 ArduPilot 源代码。本教程假设 APM 源代码位于 "
"C:\\\\Users\\\\Public\\\\Documents\\\\ardupilot-Copter-3.1.3。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:94
#: aff6b2bf20884ffcba33a3e93786e557
msgid ""
"Get the latest released code zip files \"Plane x.x.x\" `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`__ or use :ref:`Git Hub <where-to-get-the-"
"code>` to create a clone of the current code. If you want a specific release"
" version go to the `ardupilot <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__ "
"repository, select the desired ardupilot branch, then click download zip."
msgstr ""
"从 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`__ 获取最新发布代码 zip 文件「Plane x.x.x」，或使用 "
":ref:`Git Hub <where-to-get-the-code>` 克隆当前代码。如果需要特定发布版本，请前往 `ardupilot "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__ 仓库，选择所需分支，然后点击下载 zip。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:100
#: b6c1f219250a4ddb9d6cdcf842e2e264
msgid ""
"Download and install Visual Micro from the \\ `Visual Micro "
"<https://www.visualmicro.com/>`__ website and compete the `setup "
"<https://www.visualmicro.com/post/2011/10/04/How-to-test-a-new-installation-"
"of-Arduino-for-Visual-Studio.aspx>`__. Instructions are at the site."
msgstr ""
"从 `Visual Micro <https://www.visualmicro.com/>`__ 网站下载并安装 Visual Micro，并完成 "
"`setup <https://www.visualmicro.com/post/2011/10/04/How-to-test-a-new-"
"installation-of-Arduino-for-Visual-Studio.aspx>`__。说明在该网站上。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:103
#: 511abd143d65492a98496c200f3e70a2
msgid ""
"Test Visual Micro for Arduino using these `instructions "
"<https://www.visualmicro.com/post/2011/10/04/How-to-test-a-new-installation-"
"of-Arduino-for-Visual-Studio.aspx>`__. Get it working before you proceed."
msgstr ""
"按照这些 `instructions <https://www.visualmicro.com/post/2011/10/04/How-to-test-"
"a-new-installation-of-Arduino-for-Visual-Studio.aspx>`__ 测试 Arduino 的 Visual"
" Micro。先让它正常运行后再继续。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:106
#: cb4f52ee299642bfb7ebb9f4be4bbed8
msgid ""
"Download and install the APM board information.  This is a key requirement "
"to build and upload the APM code."
msgstr "下载并安装 APM 开发板信息。这是构建和上传 APM 代码的关键要求。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:109
#: f6f79104012d47cebb4f03822e7d3740
msgid ""
"Go to the \\ `Apm - Installation Guide "
"<https://www.visualmicro.com/post/2013/05/02/APM-Installation-Guide.aspx>`__"
" on the Visual Micro Forum. Read the post, then download the `boards.txt "
"file <https://www.visualmicro.com/downloads/APM_Sketchbook_Hardware.zip>`__."
msgstr ""
"前往 Visual Micro 论坛上的 `Apm - Installation Guide "
"<https://www.visualmicro.com/post/2013/05/02/APM-Installation-"
"Guide.aspx>`__。阅读帖子，然后下载 `boards.txt 文件 "
"<https://www.visualmicro.com/downloads/APM_Sketchbook_Hardware.zip>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:113
#: 6d4f3fa1dff1406bb46757f2d4ebc9fa
msgid ""
"Put the file  \"boards.txt\" into a folder \"APM\" within the folder "
"\"Arduino/hardware\".  Regardless of where you Arduino IDE is located your "
"Arduino folder (in this case C:\\\\ArduPilot-Arduino-1.0.3-windows) should "
"look like this:"
msgstr ""
"将文件「boards.txt」放入「Arduino/hardware」文件夹内的「APM」文件夹中。无论您的 Arduino IDE 位于何处，您的 "
"Arduino 文件夹（本例为 C:\\\\ArduPilot-Arduino-1.0.3-windows）应如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:122
#: ce8228c8d0d74f47965e6fb603643d5e
msgid "Run Atmel Studio or Visual Studio and set up for APM as follows:"
msgstr "运行 Atmel Studio 或 Visual Studio，按如下方式为 APM 进行设置："

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:122
#: b92cb39893ec4b9ca18b67049ddf928d
msgid "(APM2 is used in this example.)"
msgstr "（本例使用 APM2。）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:124
#: 98587c9db56d4f72bb137b26e4a2c6f3
msgid "Tools>>Visual Micro>>Boards:  Select  Arduino Mega 2560 HAL (Apm 2)"
msgstr "Tools>>Visual Micro>>Boards：选择 Arduino Mega 2560 HAL (Apm 2)"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:126
#: 44308673000d4b39965659ba8bb2b4b1
msgid ""
"Tools>>Options>>Visual Micro: On right of window, select Applications & "
"Locations>>Application Ide Locations>>Click to configure Ide locations:  In "
"the dialog window:"
msgstr ""
"Tools>>Options>>Visual Micro：在窗口右侧，选择 Applications & Locations>>Application "
"Ide Locations>>Click to configure Ide locations：在对话窗口中："

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:130
#: 1de3d0259edb4a85bec54168f2e828d9
msgid "Select Arduino to \"1.0.x: in the drop down text box."
msgstr "在下拉文本框中选择 Arduino「1.0.x」。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:131
#: a454393dfd6f4d29b36e639536915a64
msgid ""
"Set the ide folder location to C:\\\\ArduPilot-Arduino-1.0.3-windows  (or "
"the location of your Arduino IDE)."
msgstr ""
"将 IDE 文件夹位置设置为 C:\\\\ArduPilot-Arduino-1.0.3-windows（或您的 Arduino IDE 所在位置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:134
#: 1d328e4b2e114166bd9738bd21463684
msgid ""
"Set the sketchbook location to "
"C:\\\\Users\\\\Public\\\\Documents\\\\ardupilot-Copter-3.1.3  (or the "
"location of your ArduPilot code)."
msgstr ""
"将 sketchbook 位置设置为 C:\\\\Users\\\\Public\\\\Documents\\\\ardupilot-"
"Copter-3.1.3（或您的 ArduPilot 代码所在位置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:137
#: 8449cc07d33a464b8d05d78b9163d8b8
msgid ""
"Note: This is the folder containing folders APMover2, Copter, Plane, docs, "
"FollowMe, libraries, mk and Tools."
msgstr ""
"注意：这是包含 APMover2、Copter、Plane、docs、FollowMe、libraries、mk 和 Tools 文件夹的目录。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:140
#: 682dc58ef9494cf9a10344bc30262d98
msgid "Here is how the setup should look for this tutorial:"
msgstr "本教程的设置应如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:147
#: f7464aff6bec4e52b225c612c2290989
msgid "Open the arducopter.pde sketch:  File>>Open>>Sketch Project:"
msgstr "打开 arducopter.pde sketch：File>>Open>>Sketch Project："

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:149
#: b621eb3231f24c8fb00a8a743cab26e2
msgid ""
"Select Copter\\\\arducopter.pde  (or arducopter.pde file in you code "
"folder.)"
msgstr "选择 Copter\\\\arducopter.pde（或您代码文件夹中的 arducopter.pde 文件。）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:152
#: 396826cf59434594b721cc0a079d5cc4
msgid ""
"Build the code:  Build>>Clean Solution then Build>>Build Solution.  The code"
" should build without error. Depending on what source code your are using, "
"you may get the message \"Sketch too big ...\". You can reduce the size by "
"un-commenting some of the compile options in APM_Config.h."
msgstr ""
"构建代码：Build>>Clean Solution 然后 Build>>Build "
"Solution。代码应无错误地构建完成。根据您使用的源代码，可能会收到「Sketch too big ...」消息。您可以通过取消注释 "
"APM_Config.h 中的某些编译选项来减小大小。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:157
#: e2b2539c1c274f968f1dc850575d8749
msgid ""
"**Important:** Each time you change a #define statement (or comment one or "
"un-comment one) you must do Build>>Clean Solution followed by Build>>Rebuild"
" Solution.  Details are below in the Hints and Notes section."
msgstr ""
"**重要：** 每次更改 #define 语句（或注释/取消注释一个）时，必须执行 Build>>Clean Solution，然后执行 "
"Build>>Rebuild Solution。详情见下方提示和注意事项部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:163
#: bd368e48a1cd43998e03e9d2d498f62e
msgid "Uploading the code"
msgstr "上传代码"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:165
#: 4d17894b687f4adbb2590ca847fd21d1
msgid ""
"After your code builds without errors you can upload the firmware to the "
"APM."
msgstr "代码无错误构建后，您可以将固件上传到 APM。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:168
#: c2ba501b25be42f89d83e53abf7a4b59
msgid "First do this:"
msgstr "首先执行以下操作："

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:170
#: b06992e0c2414109b9c2db34d01db1de
msgid ""
"Tools>>Options>>Visual Micro -Micro Debug - Advanced: Set Automatic "
"debugging to False. Then F5 will upload without debugging - saving the need "
"to press CTRL with F5."
msgstr ""
"Tools>>Options>>Visual Micro - Micro Debug - Advanced：将 Automatic debugging "
"设置为 False。这样 F5 将直接上传而不调试——省去了按 CTRL+F5 的步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:174
#: c829da34da1b4efdaf4310006c2348e2
msgid "Connect your APM via the USB cable."
msgstr "通过 USB 线连接您的 APM。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:175
#: e71c4dc6af914ffa8968b1518023bd1a
msgid ""
"Tools>>Visual Micro>>Serial Port. Set to the USB port detected for your APM."
" If the USB port is not detected, follow the Arduino installation "
"instructions for adding the proper drivers.  If the Arduino IDE works, then "
"Visual Studio / Visual Micro should also work."
msgstr ""
"Tools>>Visual Micro>>Serial Port。设置为检测到的 APM 的 USB 端口。如果未检测到 USB 端口，请按照 "
"Arduino 安装说明添加正确的驱动程序。如果 Arduino IDE 正常运行，Visual Studio / Visual Micro "
"也应该能正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:180
#: a0d12d5be856472e818726641ad2559b
msgid "To upload to the APM board, just press F5."
msgstr "要上传到 APM 开发板，只需按 F5。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:182
#: 54c6dc6f80dd41e2897413cd9ee48a6a
msgid ""
"The build, and upload to the APM was flight tested by the author for the "
"code release 3.1.3. The flight modes stabilize, altitude hold and loiter "
"were all tested and behaved the same as upload of the same revision using "
"Mission Planner.  However, be aware that building your own upload from the "
"source can result in unexpected results. You must configure all the options "
"defines and other code correctly. Be careful, have fun and enjoy Visual "
"Studio with Visual Micro."
msgstr ""
"作者对代码版本 3.1.3 的构建和上传进行了飞行测试。Stabilize、AltHold 和 Loiter 飞行模式均经过测试，与使用 Mission"
" Planner 上传同一版本的表现相同。但请注意，自行从源代码构建并上传可能会产生意外结果。您必须正确配置所有选项定义和其他代码。请谨慎操作，祝使用 "
"Visual Studio 与 Visual Micro 愉快。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:191
#: b598870430ba453aba2eda16d34b7f5d
msgid "Hints and Notes"
msgstr "提示与注意事项"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:193
#: 9e740e61766545beb762d0688d31c5ce
msgid ""
"This procedure was tested to build and upload to the APM on the authors PC. "
"There are other ways to configure Arduino, Atmel Studio, Visual Studio, and "
"Visual Micro. Those methods are left to the reader. For instance, you can "
"install the ArduPilot Arduino IDE in any location, not just in the Programs "
"area. It is suggested to use this process first to verify everything works."
msgstr ""
"本流程已在作者的 PC 上测试可构建并上传到 APM。还有其他配置 Arduino、Atmel Studio、Visual Studio 和 "
"Visual Micro 的方式，具体方法留给读者自行探索。例如，您可以将 ArduPilot Arduino IDE 安装在任何位置，不一定是 "
"Programs 目录。建议先按照本流程验证一切正常。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:200
#: 3ecfe7b8d25548d8adabe2f285f7b933
msgid ""
"**Ways to reduce the size of Copter so it will build:** In Visual Studio or "
"Atmel Studio solution panel (where the source files are listed), open the "
"file Copter/Header Files/APM_Config.h and un-comment some of the #Define XXX"
" DISABLED lines to save some space. I.E. disable  MOUNT, OPTFLOW, "
"CAMERA,CONFIG_SONAR and/or PARACHUTE as appropriate for your APM.  Each time"
" you change a define you must do Build>>Clean Solution followed by "
"Build>>Rebuild Solution."
msgstr ""
"**减小 Copter 大小以便成功构建的方法：** 在 Visual Studio 或 Atmel Studio 解决方案面板（源文件列表处）中，打开"
" Copter/Header Files/APM_Config.h 文件，取消注释部分 #Define XXX DISABLED "
"行以节省空间，例如禁用适合您 APM 的 MOUNT、OPTFLOW、CAMERA、CONFIG_SONAR 和/或 PARACHUTE。每次修改 "
"define 后都必须执行 Build>>Clean Solution，然后执行 Build>>Rebuild Solution。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:208
#: 779904c0e8a343a9b13dcb81443ab8b2
msgid ""
"**Errors building from fresh source clone:**  The first time you set the "
"application location (for instance after getting a fresh clone of the "
"source) or change the IDE you are using, you may get build errors even "
"though you have selected the correct Arduino board.  To get an error free "
"build, just re-select the correct board. See Multiple installs of Arduino "
"below for one reason this may occur."
msgstr ""
"**从全新源码克隆构建时的错误：** 第一次设置应用程序位置（例如在获取全新克隆后）或更改所使用的 IDE 时，即使已选择正确的 Arduino "
"开发板，也可能出现构建错误。要获得无错误的构建，只需重新选择正确的开发板。多个 Arduino 安装（见下文）是可能原因之一。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:215
#: 577f00cefe0e4167960a0bd8d653e34e
msgid ""
"**Fast compile vs changing defines:**  Visual Micro has a default option for"
" fast compiles. This is setup as the default. The IDE checks for changes to "
"files and if there are no changes, does not recompile unchanged files.  This"
" really great feature has a side effect when define statements are changed "
"because they effect other files but do not specifically change the text "
"(code) thus files effected by defines will not be recompiled causing a real "
"mess.  There are two ways to avoid this issue:"
msgstr ""
"**快速编译与更改 define：** Visual Micro 默认启用快速编译选项。IDE "
"会检查文件变化，若没有变化则不重新编译未修改的文件。这个很棒的功能在更改 define 语句时有副作用，因为 define "
"影响其他文件但不直接修改这些文件的文本（代码），因此受 define 影响的文件不会被重新编译，导致混乱。有两种方法可以避免此问题："

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:224
#: ed009ba50bf64e6db4b045c56fc44143
msgid ""
"Each and every time you change a define or un-comment a define or comment a "
"define do this:"
msgstr "每次更改、取消注释或注释 define 时，请执行以下操作："

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:227
#: 11e57e1829e847f79010bedae0211b66
msgid "Build>>Clean>>Solution (That will clean out the pre-compiled cache)"
msgstr "Build>>Clean>>Solution（这将清除预编译缓存）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:228
#: 74792e7c5cb34509b76195e3b066699e
msgid "Build>>Rebuild"
msgstr "Build>>Rebuild"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:229
#: 030e48b861704b93a134dee8ea3fc1ad
msgid ""
"All following builds (assuming no changes to defines) can be the really fast"
" version Build>>Build Solution"
msgstr "所有后续构建（假设 define 没有变化）可以使用真正的快速版本 Build>>Build Solution"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:232
#: 935009c2eb444edb98ee6669ac60c02f
msgid ""
"Or, if you like to wait a long time for each compile you can change the "
"Visual Micro options"
msgstr "或者，如果您不介意每次编译都等待很长时间，可以更改 Visual Micro 选项"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:235
#: 6efd858ac7d1454e870550de9164c154
msgid ""
"Tools>>Options.   Select Visual Micro. scroll down to Compiler Optimisation."
" Hey, in UK they spell it that way."
msgstr "Tools>>Options。选择 Visual Micro，向下滚动到 Compiler Optimisation。注：英国拼写方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:237
#: 9db2a87ace264d448bca8be0418cb95c
msgid "Set Core Modified and Library Modified to False"
msgstr "将 Core Modified 和 Library Modified 设置为 False"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:239
#: 402d1c585fab4abf98b4060ddcaed54e
msgid ""
"Multiple installs of Arduino:  It is important to note that Arduino has only"
" one location where the parameters are stored - in "
"C:\\\\Users\\\\....\\\\AppData\\\\Roaming\\\\Arduino\\\\preferences.txt.  "
"Any time you start any installation of Arduino - a standard version, the "
"ArduPilot Arduino version or even changing settings in Visual Micro - that "
"file may get changed.  So, it is very important to check all the settings in"
" the IDE you are using each time you change the IDE - to avoid having the "
"preferences set to that of the last IDE you used."
msgstr ""
"多个 Arduino 安装：需要注意的是，Arduino "
"只有一个存储参数的位置——C:\\\\Users\\\\....\\\\AppData\\\\Roaming\\\\Arduino\\\\preferences.txt。每次启动任何"
" Arduino 安装——标准版、ArduPilot Arduino 版，甚至在 Visual Micro "
"中更改设置——该文件都可能被修改。因此，每次切换 IDE 时，务必检查所使用 IDE 中的所有设置，以避免参数被设置为上次使用的 IDE 的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:248
#: b9883cf987ca4dae8db60e1475dc92b4
msgid ""
"**Referencing a standard Arduino in Visual Micro:** Normally, Visual Micro "
"is setup to reference a standard installation of Arduino instead of the "
"special ArduPilot Ardunio for the HAL versions of APM.  You can configure "
"Visual Studio or Atmel Studio to reference a standard installation and it "
"may build and upload the APM code but that upload will not work.  The build "
"size is different and it does not connect to Mission Planner. It is strongly"
" suggested you only reference the special ArduPilot Arduino installation "
"when working with APM code."
msgstr ""
"**在 Visual Micro 中引用标准 Arduino：** 通常 Visual Micro 被设置为引用标准 Arduino 安装，而非用于 "
"APM HAL 版本的特殊 ArduPilot Arduino。您可以配置 Visual Studio 或 Atmel Studio "
"引用标准安装，它可能能构建并上传 APM 代码，但上传后将无法使用。构建大小不同，且无法连接到 Mission Planner。强烈建议在使用 APM "
"代码时只引用特殊的 ArduPilot Arduino 安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:257
#: 81f3c0f7984d45a4a68c193f8ccc0491
msgid ""
"**Using Arduino statements and libraries:** This is better stated as not "
"using standard Arduino statements.  The newer HAL versions of ArduPilot for "
"the APM boards removed most, if not all, of the standard Arduino statements "
"and libraries.  You can not just add an analogRead(sensorPin) statement for "
"instance. So, do not be frustrated if you try to use the standard Arduino "
"language reference to edit the APM code - it will mostly not work. There are"
" equivalent calls and statements for the APM but you will have to search for"
" examples in the code."
msgstr ""
"**使用 Arduino 语句和库：** 这更准确地说是「不使用」标准 Arduino 语句。适用于 APM 开发板的新版 HAL 版本 "
"ArduPilot 已移除大部分（甚至全部）标准 Arduino 语句和库。例如，您无法直接添加 analogRead(sensorPin) "
"语句。因此，如果尝试使用标准 Arduino 语言参考来编辑 APM 代码，大多数情况下是无效的，不要感到沮丧。APM "
"中有等效的调用和语句，但您需要在代码中搜索示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:268
#: 3e6284cdcb83419a945b4b276f716ac1
msgid ""
"**Building Older Versions of ArduPilot:** If you are still working with "
"version 2.9.1b or possibly older versions prior to HAL, you can take "
"advantage of the Atmel Studio or Visual Studio and Visual Micro IDE."
msgstr ""
"**构建旧版 ArduPilot：** 如果您仍在使用版本 2.9.1b 或 HAL 之前的更旧版本，您可以利用 Atmel Studio 或 "
"Visual Studio 与 Visual Micro IDE。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:273
#: 29f37f8f92fb47fcac74de170969e088
msgid "You just need to do the following:"
msgstr "您只需执行以下操作："

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:275
#: 721332c0088e4f9789726276f9463d9a
msgid ""
"Download the version of `ArduPilot Arduino that supports the 2.x.x revisions"
" <https://code.google.com/archive/p/ardupilot-mega/downloads>`__. Don't "
"confuse this with the current version. They have the same name but are "
"different."
msgstr ""
"下载支持 2.x.x 版本的 `ArduPilot Arduino "
"<https://code.google.com/archive/p/ardupilot-"
"mega/downloads>`__。不要与当前版本混淆，它们名字相同但不同。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:278
#: 1937655dbfc44e9c80988cb2e07600db
msgid ""
"Install the ArduPilot Arduino in a separate folder, and add the "
"apm/boards.txt file into the hardware folder - like the above instructions."
msgstr ""
"将 ArduPilot Arduino 安装在单独的文件夹中，并按照上述说明将 apm/boards.txt 文件添加到 hardware 文件夹。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:281
#: d51f60ed54a941bf9686a9395b73972e
msgid ""
"In Atmel (or Visual) Studio, in Tools>>Options>>Visual Micro, set the "
"Applications and Arduino locations to reference the ArduPilot Arduino that "
"supports the 2.x.x revisions, and to the folder containing the 2.x.x source "
"code. You can get the 2.9.1b code at the `diydrones/ardupilot "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__ repository, select the desired "
"ardupilot branch, then click download zip."
msgstr ""
"在 Atmel（或 Visual）Studio 的 Tools>>Options>>Visual Micro 中，将 Applications 和 "
"Arduino 位置设置为指向支持 2.x.x 版本的 ArduPilot Arduino，以及包含 2.x.x 源代码的文件夹。您可以在 "
"`diydrones/ardupilot <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__ 仓库中获取 "
"2.9.1b 代码，选择所需 ardupilot 分支，然后点击下载 zip。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:287
#: 90fd13ec8bf442f39934432af7907195
msgid "Set Tools>>Visual Micro>>Boards to APM Arduino Mega 2560."
msgstr "将 Tools>>Visual Micro>>Boards 设置为 APM Arduino Mega 2560。"
